    {
      "text": "Seven market-rate homes and two low-income townhomes. On hold pending applicant information.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page: single-family homes about 2,933 to 2,965 sq ft each; townhome units about 1,535 sq ft each. Parking is two garage spaces per single-family home, one garage space per townhome, plus two open spaces. Access is by a private driveway from Saratoga Los Gatos Rd. The city is reviewing the level of environmental analysis required.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The July 17, 2025 inconsistency letter lists the site as zoned R-1-40,000 and finds the project inconsistent with that district's standards for site coverage (35% maximum), floor area, building height (26 feet), minimum lot size (40,000 sq ft), lot dimensions and setbacks, and states that the multifamily dwellings on Lot 8 are not a permitted use in the district.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004097"
      ]
    }
